<title>HONG KONG: Trade in CDW Int'l shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in CDW Int'l shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of textile group CDW International Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Friday.  </p>
<p>The company's shares ended unchanged at HK$1.09 each on Thursday on volume of 8,000 shares.</p>
<p>In February, CDW International's controlling shareholder CDW Holdings Ltd was offering to buy all shares held by minority shareholders for HK$1.20 per share.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
